# game/week9.rpy:13
translate indonesian week9_start_1bd1ba20:

    # n "The sound of the school bell's ring fills the room in a familiar rhythm, signaling the usual 12 PM break."
    n  "Dentang bel istirahat sekolah bergema di sekeliling ruangan dengan ritme yang begitu familiar, menandakan tibanya jam istirahat siang pukul dua belas tepat."

# game/week9.rpy:14
translate indonesian week9_start_6ee7d0d9:

    # n "After the events of Saturday night, the return to routine feels welcome and reassuring, a breath of fresh air for your mind."
    n  "Setelah peristiwa berharga di malam Minggu kemarin, kembalinya rutinitas sekolah terasa begitu menenangkan dan menyegarkan kembali pikiranmu."

# game/week9.rpy:15
translate indonesian week9_start_cb77ce36:

    # n "You stretch in your seat to the warmth of the afternoon sun after the long lesson period, and as you do, catch a glimpse of Trida's figure approaching with a beaming grin and phone in hand."
    n  "Kamu meregangkan badan di kursimu menikmati hangatnya mentari siang setelah melewati jam pelajaran yang panjang, dan tepat saat itu, matamu menangkap sosok Trida yang melangkah mendekat dengan senyum semringah dan ponsel di tangan."

# game/week9.rpy:16
translate indonesian week9_start_693e14ae:

    # n "Although it feels as though you can feel their animated presence before you even see them."
    n  "Meskipun rasanya kamu sudah bisa merasakan energi lincahnya bahkan sebelum sosoknya benar-benar terlihat oleh matamu."

# game/week9.rpy:19
translate indonesian week9_start_ba645955:

    # trida "[player_name]!!!"
    trida  "[player_name]!!!"

# game/week9.rpy:20
translate indonesian week9_start_409ed339:

    # n "Trida's urgent booming voice was only amplified by how close their face was to yours, their eyes wide open in delight and breaths labored as visible sweat dripped down their neck."
    n  "Suara lantang Trida yang menggelegar terdengar semakin nyaring karena wajahnya yang begitu dekat dengan wajahmu, matanya membelalak gembira dan napasnya terengah-engah dengan bulir keringat yang membasahi lehernya."

# game/week9.rpy:21
translate indonesian week9_start_0fd03639:

    # n "You wondered what Trida could've been possibly doing during class to inflict such a reaction."
    n  "Kamu sempat bertanya-tanya apa yang sebenarnya dilakukan Trida di dalam kelas tadi sampai bisa seheboh ini."

# game/week9.rpy:23
translate indonesian week9_start_f3079882:

    # trida "Check it out—I—I finally got my first full combo on a level 25!"
    trida  "Coba lihat ini—a—aku akhirnya berhasil dapet full combo pertama di lagu level 25!"

# game/week9.rpy:24
translate indonesian week9_start_bc8a298e:

    # n "You're given no time to respond before Trida shoves their phone in your face."
    n  "Kamu bahkan belum sempat menjawab sebelum Trida buru-buru menyodorkan layar ponselnya tepat di depan matamu."

# game/week9.rpy:25
translate indonesian week9_start_49633b0e:

    # n "You quickly grab Trida's arm and back the screen away before you go blind from the bright neon game they're trying to show you."
    n  "Kamu sigap memegang lengan Trida dan memundurkan layarnya sedikit sebelum matamu mendadak buta akibat terpaan cahaya neon mencolok dari game yang ia pamerkan."

# game/week9.rpy:26
translate indonesian week9_start_540dd56f:

    # n "You squint at the game text and read the aforementioned words 'FULL COMBO' pop up. You see that Trida was playing their favorite rhythm game, 'Splashy!Scene' on an Expert difficulty."
    n  "Kamu menyipitkan mata membaca teks bertuliskan 'FULL COMBO' yang terpampang jelas di layar. Terlihat bahwa Trida baru saja memainkan game rhythm favoritnya, 'Splashy!Scene' pada tingkat kesulitan Expert."

# game/week9.rpy:28
translate indonesian week9_start_3550dd7e:

    # trida "Huge improvement, am I right?! I still can't believe I pulled off those ladder notes, I was basically holding my breath the entire time…!"
    trida  "Peningkatan pesat banget kan, ya nggak?! Masih nggak nyangka aku bisa ngelewatin tangga nada rapat-rapat itu, tadi aku bener-bener nahan napas sepanjang lagu...!"

# game/week9.rpy:34
translate indonesian week9_start_ac6772fd:

    # n "Trida chuckled in gratification, a giddy smirk showing through the corners of their lips; you could see a twinkle in their eyes."
    n  "Trida tertawa puas penuh kebanggaan, seringai girang tersungging di sudut bibirnya; kamu bisa melihat binar bahagia yang berpendar di matanya."

# game/week9.rpy:35
translate indonesian week9_start_74772ba4:

    # n "Trida's tone was humorous, but you could sense they were genuinely psyched by the new achievement."
    n  "Nada bicaranya terdengar jenaka, namun kamu bisa merasakan betapa ia benar-benar sangat bahagia atas pencapaian barunya itu."

# game/week9.rpy:36
translate indonesian week9_start_402ce4ef:

    # trida "You bet I did! Heh, crazy, right?"
    trida  "Pasti dong! Hehe, gila kan kerennya?"

# game/week9.rpy:40
translate indonesian week9_start_56f7e92d:

    # trida "Hey! What's that supposed to mean?!"
    trida  "Hei! Maksudmu gimana coba ngomong begitu?!"

# game/week9.rpy:41
translate indonesian week9_start_d1619784:

    # n "Trida's lips scrunch into a childish pout as they whined out each word."
    n  "Bibir Trida mengerucut cemberut kekanak-kanakan seraya merengek manja di tiap kata yang ia ucapkan."

# game/week9.rpy:42
translate indonesian week9_start_8480bc45:

    # n "Despite Trida's typical reaction when teased, you couldn't help but find this expression of theirs more endearing than usual."
    n  "Meskipun itu adalah reaksi khas Trida saat digoda, kamu tak kuasa merasa bahwa ekspresinya kali ini terlihat jauh lebih menggemaskan daripada biasanya."

# game/week9.rpy:43
translate indonesian week9_start_1293590e:

    # n "You let out a quiet, amused chuckle."
    n  "Kamu melepaskan tawa kecil yang geli."

# game/week9.rpy:44
translate indonesian week9_start_2da10b49:

    # p "Just wasn't expecting the strong reaction is all."
    p  "Cuma nggak nyangka aja reaksimu bakal seheboh ini."

# game/week9.rpy:46
translate indonesian week9_start_9aeb0142:

    # trida "Well I'd say my reaction was very reasonable, if I do say so myself!"
    trida  "Ya wajar dong kalau aku heboh, pencapaian luar biasa gini masa nggak dirayain!"

# game/week9.rpy:49
translate indonesian week9_start_7d5d6950:

    # n "Trida let out a small proud huff, redirecting their gaze back to the phone screen with a radiant grin as their fingers fervently screenshotted the feat repeatedly as though it would disappear at a moment's notice."
    n  "Trida mendengus bangga, lalu kembali menatap layar ponselnya dengan senyuman berseri-seri seraya jemarinya berkali-kali mengambil tangkapan layar seolah bukti itu bisa lenyap sewaktu-waktu."

# game/week9.rpy:50
translate indonesian week9_start_481a74f5:

    # n "The sudden switch from the vulnerable Trida in your room was evident in every little jittery mannerism."
    n  "Perubahan drastis dari sosok rapuh yang menangis di kamarmu kemarin begitu kontras terlihat di setiap gerak-gerik lincahnya saat ini."

# game/week9.rpy:51
translate indonesian week9_start_2a474309:

    # n "As Trida's eyebrows perked up in delight, you found yourself paying extra attention to Trida's every move once more."
    n  "Saat alis Trida terangkat riang, kamu mendapati dirimu kembali terpaku memperhatikan setiap detail gerakannya dengan saksama."

# game/week9.rpy:52
translate indonesian week9_start_d21a6f62:

    # n "How their feet shuffle on the floor from side to side, how their thumbs frantically hover over the phone screen, how their cheeks tremble with how intensely they tense their smile…"
    n  "Bagaimana kakinya bergeser ke kanan dan ke kiri di lantai, bagaimana kedua ibu jarinya lincah melayang di atas layar ponsel, bagaimana pipinya berkedut menahan senyuman yang begitu lebar..."

# game/week9.rpy:55
translate indonesian week9_start_591cd629:

    # trida "Uh—[player_name]? Do I look funny or something?"
    trida  "Uh—[player_name]? Mukaku ada yang aneh ya?"

# game/week9.rpy:56
translate indonesian week9_start_726ad7c3:

    # n "Your thoughts get interrupted by Trida's face leaning in so close you could see the warm flush of fluster taking form on their ears, a confused smile and furrowed brows playing on their features as you realize that you had been staring at them for what probably felt oddly long."
    n  "Lamunanmu buyar saat wajah Trida mencondong begitu dekat hingga kamu bisa melihat semburat merah muda yang hangat mulai menjalar di daun telinganya; senyum bingung dan kerutan dahi menghiasi wajahnya saat kamu tersadar bahwa sedari tadi kamu sudah menatapnya cukup lama."

# game/week9.rpy:60
translate indonesian week9_start_570e1bcb:

    # p "Sorry, I was spaced out."
    p  "Maaf, tadi aku lagi melamun."

# game/week9.rpy:62
translate indonesian week9_start_6b632bcc:

    # p "It's nothing."
    p  "Nggak ada apa-apa kok."

# game/week9.rpy:64
translate indonesian week9_start_5fd2b725:

    # p "Just… thinking."
    p  "Cuma... lagi mikir aja."

# game/week9.rpy:66
translate indonesian week9_start_02954004:

    # n "You croak out your quick excuse, however unconvincing it was judging by Trida's quiet chuckles."
    n  "Kamu melontarkan alasan kilat itu dengan agak serak, terdengar sama sekali tidak meyakinkan jika dinilai dari tawa kecil Trida yang menggoda."

# game/week9.rpy:68
translate indonesian week9_start_0652c5b8:

    # trida "I mean, you looked pretty focused on me just now…"
    trida  "Padahal tadi tatapanmu fokus banget ngeliatin aku lho..."

# game/week9.rpy:69
translate indonesian week9_start_d93b27f9:

    # n "Despite the joking words, Trida's tender voice would suggest otherwise."
    n  "Meski kalimatnya bernada gurauan, suara lembut Trida mengisyaratkan kehangatan yang berbeda."

# game/week9.rpy:70
translate indonesian week9_start_3b3106e1:

    # n "Their eyes darted away for a moment, lips pressed together as if physically holding back the words as they fiddled with their phone buttons."
    n  "Pandangannya sempat teralihkan sesaat, bibirnya terkatup rapat seolah sedang menahan kata-kata seraya jemarinya memainkan tombol samping ponselnya."

# game/week9.rpy:72
translate indonesian week9_start_771d8703:

    # n "The unspoken question hung in the air, about how Trida was feeling being in class again."
    n  "Pertanyaan yang tak terucap menggantung lembut di udara, tentang bagaimana perasaan Trida kembali masuk ke dalam kelas ini."

# game/week9.rpy:73
translate indonesian week9_start_0544706a:

    # n "Trida started to redirect their attention back to their game. They rested their elbows on the rough wood surface of your desk and bent down to comfortably play, closing the proximity."
    n  "Trida mulai mengalihkan kembali perhatiannya ke permainannya. Ia menyandarkan sikunya di atas permukaan kayu mejamu yang kasar dan membungkuk agar nyaman bermain, mempersempit jarak di antara kalian berdua."

# game/week9.rpy:74
translate indonesian week9_start_94558e5c:

    # n "You could feel the tension in your throat, as if itching to get the words out, but with how increasingly content Trida became in your presence, the opportunity kept slipping at the risk of ruining the mood."
    n  "Kamu merasakan tenggorokanmu tercekat, ingin sekali membuka obrolan, namun melihat betapa tenangnya Trida di dekatmu saat ini, kesempatan itu terus tertahan karena takut merusak suasana nyaman itu."

# game/week9.rpy:76
translate indonesian week9_start_90d82679:

    # trida "Hm... Let me try this level 27 one..."
    trida  "Hm... Coba ah mainin lagu level 27 yang ini..."

# game/week9.rpy:78
translate indonesian week9_start_56473606:

    # n "As Trida eased back into the game, your eyes instinctively scanned through the classroom out of curiosity for what your previous groupmate was doing."
    n  "Saat Trida kembali larut bermain, tatapan matamu secara naluriah menyapu ke sekeliling kelas, penasaran mencari keberadaan teman sekelompokmu tempo hari."

# game/week9.rpy:79
translate indonesian week9_start_dd4c548f:

    # n "After checking out the rest of your classmates chatting up a storm, your eyes catch your teammate quickly looking down at his fidgeting hands with a flat expression as he gets up from his seat."
    n  "Setelah melihat teman-teman sekelas lainnya yang asyik mengobrol riuh, matamu menangkap teman sekelompokmu yang berkacamata itu tengah menatap kedua tangannya yang gelisah dengan raut wajah datar sebelum ia beranjak bangkit dari tempat duduknya."

# game/week9.rpy:80
translate indonesian week9_start_2e528453:

    # n "Your gaze flickered in quick glances between Trida and your teammate. You could spot him seemingly making his way closer to your desk. You…"
    n  "Pandanganmu bergerak cepat bergantian antara Trida dan teman sekelompokmu itu. Kamu melihat cowok itu tampak melangkahkan kakinya mendekat ke arah mejamu. Kamu..."

# game/week9.rpy:84
translate indonesian week9_start_23c59914:

    # n "You promptly turned your head back to Trida."
    n  "Kamu buru-buru memalingkan kembali pandanganmu ke arah Trida."

# game/week9.rpy:85
translate indonesian week9_start_fc1945d9:

    # n "You see they've already started playing a new song in front of you without having noticed, the frantic rhythmic taps of their fingertips matching to the beat of the aggressively cheery song playing a little too loudly from their phone."
    n  "Kamu melihat ia sudah mulai memainkan lagu baru di hadapanmu tanpa menyadari sekelilingnya; ketukan ritmis jemarinya berpadu cepat mengikuti dentuman lagu ceria yang mengalun agak terlalu kencang dari pengeras suara ponselnya."

# game/week9.rpy:86
translate indonesian week9_start_3ea7041b:

    # n "You lean forward to catch a glimpse of the chart Trida was trying to complete, as well as Trida's focused eyes and a small peek of their tongue being bitten to the side."
    n  "Kamu mencondongkan tubuh ke depan untuk melihat chart nada yang sedang coba diselesaikan Trida, mengamati matanya yang fokus tajam dan ujung lidahnya yang sedikit digigit ke samping."

# game/week9.rpy:87
translate indonesian week9_start_d48f5dc6:

    # n "Despite the hastiness of Trida's play style, you could see improvement show through, however small."
    n  "Meskipun gaya bermain Trida tampak terburu-buru, kamu bisa melihat perkembangan kemampuannya kian terasah, sekecil apa pun itu."

# game/week9.rpy:89
translate indonesian week9_start_6b7b44b4:

    # p "Oh hey there!"
    p  "Halo di sana!"

# game/week9.rpy:92
translate indonesian week9_start_ef8af780:

    # glasses_boy "Ah—[player_name]…"
    glasses_boy  "Ah—[player_name]..."

# game/week9.rpy:93
translate indonesian week9_start_313d5480:

    # n "You peek from behind Trida's focused stance, hoping to catch the boy's attention, and soon enough he was looking right at you with a small frown and furrowed brows."
    n  "Kamu melongok dari balik posisi Trida yang sedang fokus bermain, berharap bisa menarik perhatian cowok itu, dan tak lama kemudian ia menatap lurus ke arahmu dengan sedikit kerutan dahi."

# game/week9.rpy:94
translate indonesian week9_start_0033e90c:

    # n "His narrowed eyes looked away as he kept walking towards you two, as if taken aback by your sudden call."
    n  "Sorot matanya yang menyipit sempat membuang muka seraya ia terus melangkah menghampiri kalian berdua, seolah agak terkejut mendengar sapaan mendadak darimu."

# game/week9.rpy:95
translate indonesian week9_start_69e4776b:

    # n "Trida didn't seem to notice a single word you shouted out, though, still obliviously giving their all into the chart with laser-focused eyes and rapid, clumsy taps on the bright phone screen."
    n  "Trida sama sekali tidak menyadari sepatah kata pun seruanmu tadi; ia masih asyik mengerahkan seluruh fokusnya pada lagu itu dengan mata terpaku lurus dan ketukan jemari yang gesit di layar ponsel."

# game/week9.rpy:99
translate indonesian week9_start_d24b7447:

    # n "You quietly observe the boy approaching from afar."
    n  "Kamu memilih memperhatikan langkah cowok itu dari kejauhan dalam diam."

# game/week9.rpy:100
translate indonesian week9_start_d0bf315a:

    # n "The rapid rhythmic taps of Trida's gameplay catch the attention of the boy; he glanced in your direction and his gaze landed on you keenly monitoring him."
    n  "Ketukan cepat jemari Trida pada layar ponsel menarik perhatian cowok itu; ia melirik ke arah mejamu dan mendapati kamu tengah mengamatinya dengan saksama."

# game/week9.rpy:101
translate indonesian week9_start_ecb98b53:

    # n "It seemed to confuse the boy a little, as his narrowed eyes did quick glances between you and the rest of the class, his movements becoming slower and more hesitant."
    n  "Hal itu tampaknya membuat si cowok agak salah tingkah; matanya yang menyipit melirik ragu bergantian antaramu dan teman-teman sekelas lainnya, langkah kakinya melambat penuh keraguan."

# game/week9.rpy:105
translate indonesian week9_start_32e4177b:

    # n "It wasn't long until the boy in glasses was awkwardly hovering around the two of you, clearly wanting to talk, but seeing how focused Trida was on beating the level 27 chart, he hesitated on interjecting."
    n  "Tak butuh waktu lama hingga cowok berkacamata itu akhirnya berdiri canggung di dekat meja kalian berdua, jelas-jelas ingin berbicara, namun ragu menyela melihat Trida yang sedang mati-matian menaklukkan lagu level 27 itu."

# game/week9.rpy:106
translate indonesian week9_start_a629fc68:

    # n "You sighed and tapped on the table to get Trida's attention."
    n  "Kamu menghela napas lalu mengetuk pelan permukaan meja untuk menarik perhatian Trida."

# game/week9.rpy:108
translate indonesian week9_start_46252aa5:

    # p "Trida, get off of Splashy for a moment, you—"
    p  "Trida, matiin dulu Splashy-nya sebentar, kamu—"

# game/week9.rpy:109
translate indonesian week9_start_3d48303d:

    # trida "Hold up, hold up!! I'm so close to finishing this, please…!"
    trida  "Tunggu bentar, tahan dulu!! Dikit lagi mau tamat nih lagunya, tolonglah...!"

# game/week9.rpy:110
translate indonesian week9_start_16ca7687:

    # n "Trida slurred out excitedly in a plea, eyes glued to the screen and finger swipes getting more and more vigorous as the song crested into a crescendo."
    n  "Trida memohon panik penuh semangat tanpa mengalihkan pandangannya dari layar, sapuan jarinya bergerak semakin membabi-buta saat alunan lagu mencapai klimaksnya."

# game/week9.rpy:111
translate indonesian week9_start_dbc72a40:

    # n "You would've thought they were playing some kind of RPG beating a final boss, but as it seemed when you looked at the health bar of Trida's game, it was one wrong tap away from dying instantly."
    n  "Orang yang melihat pasti bakal mengira ia sedang bertarung hidup dan mati melawan bos terakhir di game RPG, padahal saat kamu melirik bar nyawa di game itu, tinggal satu kesalahan kecil saja ia bakal langsung game over seketika."

# game/week9.rpy:112
translate indonesian week9_start_3f150ae0:

    # n "You shared a skeptical look with the boy as he fixed his glasses."
    n  "Kamu saling bertukar pandang heran dengan si cowok berkacamata yang tengah membetulkan letak kacamatanya."

# game/week9.rpy:114
translate indonesian week9_start_1c2275d4:

    # p "Trida, please—"
    p  "Trida, tolong dengerin dulu—"

# game/week9.rpy:115
translate indonesian week9_start_63413a94:

    # n "As you were about to try to interrupt a second time, Trida straightened their back without warning and placed their phone down on your desk, exhaling deeply as the song came to an end."
    n  "Tepat saat kamu berniat menyela untuk kedua kalinya, Trida mendadak menegakkan punggungnya dan meletakkan ponselnya ke atas meja, menghembuskan napas panjang nan lega seiring berlalunya nada terakhir lagu."

# game/week9.rpy:117
translate indonesian week9_start_c5cfc21e:

    # trida "Ahh, finally…"
    trida  "Fuihh, akhirnya kelar juga..."

# game/week9.rpy:119
translate indonesian week9_start_2df3ee67:

    # n "As though re-orienting with reality, Trida finally blinked a few times and looked around, where the boy in glasses was staring right back with a small grin, stifling a giggle at the ridiculousness of the situation."
    n  "Seolah baru kembali tersadar ke dunia nyata, Trida mengerjapkan matanya beberapa kali lalu menoleh ke samping, tempat cowok berkacamata itu tengah menatapnya dengan senyum simpul kecil, menahan tawa melihat kekonyolan situasi barusan."

# game/week9.rpy:122
translate indonesian week9_start_33ee11b5:

    # trida "AH! What the—!"
    trida  "WAAAH! Kaget, ngapain di situ—!"

# game/week9.rpy:123
translate indonesian week9_start_19af5e30:

    # n "Trida flinched back at the sudden appearance, letting out a loud yelp."
    n  "Trida terlonjak kaget melihat kemunculan mendadak itu, memekik kencang tanpa sadar."

# game/week9.rpy:124
translate indonesian week9_start_ffa9c145:

    # p "Yeah, I've been trying to tell you…"
    p  "Nah kan, dari tadi udah dibilangin juga..."

# game/week9.rpy:126
translate indonesian week9_start_14f67853:

    # trida "O-oh, it's you… Sorry…"
    trida  "E—eh, kamu... Maaf ya..."

# game/week9.rpy:128
translate indonesian week9_start_f371134a:

    # n "Trida diverted their gaze to the boy, trying to keep a small smile despite the obvious guilt showing through their shakier voice and fidgeting hands."
    n  "Trida mengalihkan pandangannya menatap cowok itu, berusaha mempertahankan senyum kecil meski rasa canggung dan bersalah masih tampak jelas dari nada suaranya yang bergetar dan jemarinya yang gelisah."

# game/week9.rpy:129
translate indonesian week9_start_92d58f76:

    # n "The boy's gaze softened at the sight of Trida's squirmy gestures; he halted before speaking in a quiet voice."
    n  "Sorot mata cowok itu melembut melihat gelagat Trida yang serba salah; ia berhenti sejenak sebelum berbicara dengan suara pelan dan tenang."

# game/week9.rpy:131
translate indonesian week9_start_96d8d822:

    # glasses_boy "Oh, it's totally alright, don't even worry about it. It's just…"
    glasses_boy  "Nggak apa-apa kok, santai aja, nggak usah dipikirin. Cuma..."

# game/week9.rpy:132
translate indonesian week9_start_41822c6e:

    # n "The boy gruffly cleared his throat, looking down at his hands."
    n  "Cowok itu berdeham pelan seraya menunduk menatap kedua tangannya sendiri."

# game/week9.rpy:133
translate indonesian week9_start_72eeb12d:

    # glasses_boy "I—I just wanted to… you know, about the last group project…"
    glasses_boy  "A—aku cuma mau ngomong... kamu tahu kan, soal tugas kelompok kemarin..."

# game/week9.rpy:134
translate indonesian week9_start_5343f336:

    # n "He dragged out his words with a lightly strained voice. Trida held their breath, waiting for him to finish."
    n  "Ia berbicara agak terbata-bata dengan nada yang sedikit tertahan. Trida menahan napasnya, menunggu kalimat kelanjutannya."

# game/week9.rpy:135
translate indonesian week9_start_a63a0955:

    # glasses_boy "…I wanted to apologize, Trida… for last time, during our discussions."
    glasses_boy  "...Aku mau minta maaf, Trida... soal omonganku pas diskusi kelompok kemarin."

# game/week9.rpy:137
translate indonesian week9_start_7bd6bc28:

    # trida "…!"
    trida  "...!"

# game/week9.rpy:139
translate indonesian week9_start_97f27558:

    # glasses_boy "I just… let my confusion turn to anger and went off the deep end, when I really should've just… tried to be cool about it."
    glasses_boy  "Aku cuma... waktu itu rasa bingungku berubah jadi emosi dan aku malah kelepasan ngomong kasar, padahal harusnya aku bisa... bersikap lebih dewasa dan santai."

# game/week9.rpy:142
translate indonesian week9_start_f580d4b9:

    # n "Trida's tensed face loosened at the boy's candid apology, their eyes on him as they swallowed their breath."
    n  "Ketegangan di wajah Trida seketika mencair mendengar permintaan maaf yang begitu tulus itu; matanya menatap cowok itu seraya menghembuskan napas lega."

# game/week9.rpy:143
translate indonesian week9_start_f3ac1a61:

    # trida "It's… it's all good. I mean, I shouldn't have dragged the team down as much as I did, I understand…"
    trida  "Nggak... nggak apa-apa kok. Maksudku, aku juga salah udah bikin beban buat kelompok kemarin, aku paham kok..."

# game/week9.rpy:145
translate indonesian week9_start_4e5eb914:

    # glasses_boy "Hey, don't beat yourself up over it too much. It was only a small assignment, wasn't it?"
    glasses_boy  "Hei, jangan terlalu menyalahkan dirimu sendiri gitu. Lagian itu cuma tugas kecil biasa kan?"

# game/week9.rpy:146
translate indonesian week9_start_b6ae0a75:

    # n "The boy cracked a small, awkward smile, his voice low and light-hearted—a grin that suited the usually stone-faced boy a little better."
    n  "Cowok itu menyunggingkan senyum tipis yang canggung, nada suaranya terdengar ramah dan ringan—senyuman yang terasa jauh lebih pas menghiasi wajahnya yang biasanya kaku tanpa ekspresi."

# game/week9.rpy:147
translate indonesian week9_start_f3ca90fc:

    # n "Trida seemed just as pleasantly surprised as you were."
    n  "Trida tampak sama terkejut dan senangnya sepertimu."

# game/week9.rpy:148
translate indonesian week9_start_2f8836d9:

    # trida "…Yeah, thanks anyway."
    trida  "...Iya, makasih banyak ya."

# game/week9.rpy:150
translate indonesian week9_start_92c8d87c:

    # glasses_boy "No, I—I should be thanking you… honestly, it made me realize how insensitive I can be. I probably wouldn't have known otherwise…"
    glasses_boy  "Nggak, justru a—aku yang harusnya berterima kasih... jujur, kejadian itu bikin aku sadar betapa judes dan nggak pekanya aku selama ini. Mungkin kalau nggak ada kejadian itu, aku nggak bakal pernah sadar..."

# game/week9.rpy:151
translate indonesian week9_start_4b175ad9:

    # n "You notice the boy's demeanor relaxing the more he talks to Trida, the grin naturally remaining on his face as he eases into the conversation."
    n  "Kamu memperhatikan bagaimana pembawaan cowok itu menjadi jauh lebih santai saat mengobrol dengan Trida; senyuman alami tetap bertengger di wajahnya saat ia larut dalam obrolan hangat itu."

# game/week9.rpy:153
translate indonesian week9_start_693b1f28:

    # trida "Really…? Well… I didn't really do anything special, but… I'm glad it helped you… somehow!"
    trida  "Beneran nih...? Ya ampun... padahal aku nggak ngelakuin hal spesial apa-apa, tapi... aku seneng banget kalau itu bisa ngebantu kamu... dengan cara apa pun!"

# game/week9.rpy:155
translate indonesian week9_start_c8e5fdb1:

    # n "Trida's happy disbelief made the atmosphere feel breathable. The boy nodded briefly before looking back at you."
    n  "Rasa tak percaya Trida yang membuncah bahagia membuat suasana di sekitar kalian kembali terasa begitu lega dan hangat. Cowok itu mengangguk pelan sebelum menoleh menatapmu."

# game/week9.rpy:156
translate indonesian week9_start_72fae3bf:

    # glasses_boy "Oh, and… thank you for keeping us in check."
    glasses_boy  "Oh iya, dan... makasih juga ya udah jagain situasi kita tetap adem."

# game/week9.rpy:157
translate indonesian week9_start_06f7c4e6:

    # p "It's nothing, I'm glad you two could talk it out."
    p  "Bukan masalah kok, aku senang kalian berdua akhirnya bisa ngobrol baik-baik."

# game/week9.rpy:158
translate indonesian week9_start_2c3fd011:

    # trida "Yeah, I feel much better…"
    trida  "Iya, rasanya plong banget sekarang..."

# game/week9.rpy:160
translate indonesian week9_start_127d32e3:

    # glasses_boy "Uhm, if you don't mind, I'm getting a little… hungry, I'll see you two later."
    glasses_boy  "Uhm, kalau kalian nggak keberatan, perutku udah mulai... laper nih, sampai ketemu lagi nanti ya kalian berdua."

# game/week9.rpy:162
translate indonesian week9_start_67ee3fcc:

    # n "The boy hurriedly excused himself, reminding both of you that it was still break period. Trida perked up at the mention of hunger, and you realize that your stomach has been grumbling as well."
    n  "Cowok itu buru-buru pamit undur diri, mengingatkan kalian berdua bahwa jam istirahat masih berlangsung. Mendengar kata lapar, mata Trida seketika berbinar cerah, dan kamu pun baru tersadar bahwa perutmu sedari tadi juga sudah mulai keroncongan."

# game/week9.rpy:164
translate indonesian week9_start_7e58817a:

    # trida "See ya…!"
    trida  "Sampai jumpa nanti...!"

# game/week9.rpy:165
translate indonesian week9_start_84975af5:

    # p "Now that he mentioned it… let's get some food."
    p  "Mumpung dia udah ngingetin soal makan... yuk cari makan sekarang."

# game/week9.rpy:166
translate indonesian week9_start_368223d5:

    # trida "My thoughts exactly! Come on, I'm starving!"
    trida  "Sepemikiran banget! Ayo buruan, aku udah kelaparan parah nih!"

# game/week9.rpy:169
translate indonesian week9_start_8d0654df:

    # n "You stood up from your seat, knowing Trida would immediately drag you away from class."
    n  "Kamu bangkit berdiri dari kursimu, sudah tahu pasti bahwa Trida akan langsung menarikmu keluar dari kelas."

# game/week9.rpy:170
translate indonesian week9_start_c4349ac8:

    # n "They reach for your wrist and run out into the hallway with you, their eyes still glued to their phone as they lead you out with little caution."
    n  "Ia meraih pergelangan tanganmu dan berlari kecil menyusuri lorong bersamamu, matanya masih saja terpaku pada layar ponsel saat menuntunmu melangkah tanpa memperhatikan jalan."

# game/week9.rpy:171
translate indonesian week9_start_0a3da939:

    # p "Couldn't you afford to look at the road a little…"
    p  "Bisa nggak sih matamu ngelihat jalanan sedikit napa..."

# game/week9.rpy:172
translate indonesian week9_start_96101841:

    # trida "Wait, this new Splashy banner…!"
    trida  "Bentar dulu, banner gacha baru di Splashy ini keren banget lho...!"

# game/week9.rpy:180
translate indonesian week9_start_97cc2892:

    # n "Trida leads you to the lively canteen. Although not without bumping into at least one other student, they swiftly pocketed their phone and approached the noodle stall."
    n  "Trida menuntunmu menuju area kantin yang riuh. Meski sempat menyenggol satu anak lain di perjalanan, ia dengan cekatan mengantongi ponselnya dan melangkah mantap menghampiri stan mi."

# game/week9.rpy:182
translate indonesian week9_start_4c22f05d:

    # trida "I'll have one of the Aceh fried noodles with an egg on the side!"
    trida  "Bu, pesan Mi Goreng Aceh-nya satu porsi ya, pakai telur ceplok!"

# game/week9.rpy:183
translate indonesian week9_start_dbbd586e:

    # n "All it took was one look at Trida's enthusiastic ordering before the lady running the stall was already up and ready to cook."
    n  "Cukup satu lirikan pada gaya memesan Trida yang penuh semangat itu, ibu penjual stan sudah langsung sigap menyalakan kompor dan bersiap memasak."

# game/week9.rpy:184
translate indonesian week9_start_8bd045e3:

    # n "You sit down on a nearby bench and lean back as Trida shifts back and forth in anticipation."
    n  "Kamu duduk di bangku panjang terdekat dan bersandar santai sementara Trida bergerak gelisah ke sana-kemari karena tak sabar menunggu."

# game/week9.rpy:186
translate indonesian week9_start_4bf062bb:

    # p "Do you have that order on speed-dial or something? The lady barely looked at you."
    p  "Kamu udah langganan banget ya di situ sampai hafal di luar kepala? Ibunya tadi bahkan nyaris nggak nengok mukamu lho."

# game/week9.rpy:188
translate indonesian week9_start_09560c87:

    # trida "Hah, what can I say? If this was a Teddy Cups stall, I would have so many loyalty cards filled to the brim by now!"
    trida  "Hahaha, jelas dong! Coba kalau ini stan minuman boba, kartu member punyaku pasti udah penuh cap stempel dari kapan tahu!"

# game/week9.rpy:189
translate indonesian week9_start_cee3a920:

    # p "Right…"
    p  "Iya deh, percaya..."

# game/week9.rpy:192
translate indonesian week9_start_730b8936:

    # n "Before you could settle on your lunch order, you notice Trida's hands confusedly rummaging through their tight pockets with a perplexed look."
    n  "Sebelum kamu sempat memutuskan mau pesan makan apa, kamu melihat tangan Trida meraba-raba saku celananya yang ketat dengan raut wajah kebingungan."

# game/week9.rpy:193
translate indonesian week9_start_641bcd32:

    # trida "Crap! I think I forgot—no, I definitely forgot my wallet!"
    trida  "Gawat! Kayaknya dompetku ketinggalan—nggak, ini fiks dompetku beneran ketinggalan di kelas!"

# game/week9.rpy:194
translate indonesian week9_start_44aead57:

    # p "How shocking…"
    p  "Sungguh mengejutkan sekali..."

# game/week9.rpy:195
translate indonesian week9_start_acf9a2b9:

    # trida "Don't go anywhere, alright?"
    trida  "Jangan ke mana-mana ya, tunggu di sini!"

# game/week9.rpy:198
translate indonesian week9_start_7fc3d681:

    # n "Hushed like a secret, Trida proceeded to sprint out of the crowd like a leaf through wind, until they had left your sight toward the hallways."
    n  "Bagai hembusan angin rahasia, Trida langsung melesat kencang membelah kerumunan orang bagai daun yang tertiup badai, hingga sosoknya menghilang dari pandangan menuju lorong kelas."

# game/week9.rpy:199
translate indonesian week9_start_504df639:

    # n "You're left to sit with yourself as you wait for Trida's noodle order on their behalf."
    n  "Kini kamu tinggal sendirian duduk di bangku itu, menunggu pesanan mi milik Trida siap dihidangkan."

# game/week9.rpy:202
translate indonesian week9_start_0dd2530e:

    # julia "Oh, hey [player_name]! It's been a while!"
    julia  "Eh, halo [player_name]! Udah lama ya nggak ketemu!"

# game/week9.rpy:203
translate indonesian week9_start_8f5e728d:

    # n "Julia greeted you with a little more excitement than what you would've expected from someone as initially reserved as her."
    n  "Julia menyapamu dengan nada yang terdengar jauh lebih ceria dan antusias dibanding biasanya untuk ukuran orang yang awalnya sangat pendiam sepertinya."

# game/week9.rpy:204
translate indonesian week9_start_c44204bb:

    # n "She made her way to the empty space beside you and sat down."
    n  "Gadis itu melangkah menghampiri bangku kosong di sebelahmu dan mendudukkan dirinya di sana."

# game/week9.rpy:205
translate indonesian week9_start_df0b80f6:

    # julia "Uhm, how are you doing these days…? You know, with all the new school life?"
    julia  "Uhm, gimana kabarmu belakangan ini...? Maksudku, adaptasi sama kehidupan sekolah barumu?"

# game/week9.rpy:209
translate indonesian week9_start_7ecbe38b:

    # julia "Yeah, I get that… So much to get used to, right…?"
    julia  "Iya, paham banget kok... Banyak hal baru yang harus dibiasakan kan ya...?"

# game/week9.rpy:211
translate indonesian week9_start_f8397a4c:

    # julia "Ah, that's good to hear…! Everyone is so nice here, aren't they?"
    julia  "Wah, syukurlah kalau begitu...! Orang-orang di sini ramah-ramah banget kan?"

# game/week9.rpy:213
translate indonesian week9_start_d4774b3a:

    # julia "I see, better than terrible I suppose…!"
    julia  "Begitu ya, tapi seenggaknya jauh lebih baik daripada ngerasa tertekan kan...!"

# game/week9.rpy:215
translate indonesian week9_start_23b4d513:

    # julia "Well, me personally, I'm looking forward to next month, you know, with Inktober and all of that… I see you've been getting close with Trida as well…"
    julia  "Kalau aku pribadi sih lagi nggak sabar nungguin bulan depan, tahu sendiri kan, ada Inktober dan segala macem... Kulihat belakangan ini kamu juga makin akrab banget ya sama Trida..."

# game/week9.rpy:216
translate indonesian week9_start_8cd7baca:

    # n "Julia trails off with her words about Trida as a thoughtful silence follows, her gaze set on her shoes."
    n  "Ucapan Julia menggantung pelan saat ia menyebut nama Trida; jeda hening yang sarat makna menyusul saat pandangan matanya tertunduk menatap ujung sepatunya."

# game/week9.rpy:218
translate indonesian week9_start_7231bbcb:

    # p "Yeah, what about me and Trida?"
    p  "Iya, emangnya kenapa sama aku dan Trida?"

# game/week9.rpy:219
translate indonesian week9_start_83f02a70:

    # julia "Oh, it's just… to be frank, I've been noticing you and Trida becoming closer for quite a while now."
    julia  "Oh, nggak kok, cuma... sejujurnya, aku udah merhatiin kalian berdua makin hari makin dekat banget."

# game/week9.rpy:220
translate indonesian week9_start_33f0b701:

    # julia "You guys seem to make a great pair. Seeing you two have fun always brings up the mood, and I can't imagine the two of you ever separating, so I was just wondering…"
    julia  "Kalian berdua tuh kelihatan serasi banget kalau barengan. Tiap kali ngelihat kalian bercanda bareng, suasananya langsung terasa lebih hidup, dan aku nggak bisa bayangin kalau kalian sampai pisah. Makanya aku sempat penasaran..."

# game/week9.rpy:223
translate indonesian week9_start_d3da5b14:

    # n "Julia suddenly turns toward you and holds eye contact, an uncharacteristic but sincere, determined look on her face."
    n  "Julia mendadak menolehkan kepalanya menatapmu lurus-lurus, ekspresi wajahnya yang biasanya malu kini berganti sorot mata yang begitu bersungguh-sungguh dan mantap."

# game/week9.rpy:224
translate indonesian week9_start_69b79774:

    # julia "Perhaps this is a bit too direct, but if you don't mind being honest with me for a second…"
    julia  "Mungkin ini kedengarannya terlalu to the point ya, tapi kalau kamu nggak keberatan buat jujur sedikit ke aku..."

# game/week9.rpy:225
translate indonesian week9_start_0738d42a:

    # julia "…Who is Trida to you, [player_name]?"
    julia  "...Sebenarnya Trida itu siapa sih buat kamu, [player_name]?"

# game/week9.rpy:232
translate indonesian week9_start_ec00aec3:

    # n "You stutter out your honest feelings, thinking back to how many times the small moments with Trida have made your heart race."
    n  "Kamu terbata-bata mengungkapkan perasaan jujurmu, mengenang kembali betapa seringnya momen-momen kecil bersama Trida berhasil membuat jantungmu berdegup liar tak keruan."

# game/week9.rpy:233
translate indonesian week9_start_7c01cac4:

    # n "Everything from the funny moments, the tender moments, the emotional Saturday night in your room… all culminating into a first admission of your feelings for Trida to Julia."
    n  "Mulai dari candaan konyol, momen-momen manis yang menyejukkan, hingga luapan emosional di malam Minggu kemarin di kamarmu... semuanya bermuara pada pengakuan pertamamu tentang perasaanmu terhadap Trida di hadapan Julia."

# game/week9.rpy:235
translate indonesian week9_start_bca182e3:

    # julia "I see…"
    julia  "Begitu ya rupanya..."

# game/week9.rpy:236
translate indonesian week9_start_f633edeb:

    # n "Julia smiles to herself upon hearing your confession, sighing quietly in relief."
    n  "Julia tersenyum simpul mendengar pengakuan hatimu, menghembuskan napas panjang dengan rasa lega yang teramat sangat."

# game/week9.rpy:237
translate indonesian week9_start_7ec6fffe:

    # p "…What? Don't go around telling people."
    p  "...Kenapa senyum-senyum gitu? Jangan disebar-sebarin ke orang lain lho ya."

# game/week9.rpy:239
translate indonesian week9_start_63a542a3:

    # julia "Oh, of course not! You see… I had a feeling you'd say that. From what I've observed, the way you look at Trida is simply unmistakable…!"
    julia  "Tentu aja nggak bakal kusebar! Tuh kan bener... dari awal aku udah punya firasat kamu bakal jawab begitu. Dari hasil pengamatanku selama ini, caramu menatap Trida itu bener-bener nggak bisa dibohongi...!"

# game/week9.rpy:240
translate indonesian week9_start_638cb50f:

    # julia "If I may admit something too, I've had a few romantic escapades with my own friends in the past, so I understand you must be feeling very conflicted."
    julia  "Kalau boleh jujur juga, dulu aku sempat punya sedikit pengalaman asmara sama teman dekatku sendiri, jadi aku paham banget kalau sekarang perasaanmu pasti lagi campur aduk nggak karuan."

# game/week9.rpy:241
translate indonesian week9_start_a16ef480:

    # p "Oh! Well… yeah, but I wouldn't have expected that from you."
    p  "Oh! Begitu ya... iya sih, tapi aku nggak nyangka aja kamu bakal sepeka ini."

# game/week9.rpy:242
translate indonesian week9_start_c9776896:

    # julia "Ah, yes, it's a long story, but—that's beside the point. If you'll let me, I want to throw in my two cents. Some advice, if you will."
    julia  "Ahaha iya, ceritanya agak panjang sih, tapi—bukan itu poin utamanya. Kalau kamu izinkan, aku pengin ngasih sedikit saran atau pandanganku nih."

# game/week9.rpy:243
translate indonesian week9_start_bdd34b2e:

    # julia "Because… I truly think you and Trida can become something special."
    julia  "Karena... menurutku kalian berdua bener-bener bisa jadi pasangan yang sangat istimewa."

# game/week9.rpy:244
translate indonesian week9_start_28eedee9:

    # p "Yeah, I'd appreciate that…"
    p  "Iya, dengan senang hati... makasih sarannya."

# game/week9.rpy:245
translate indonesian week9_start_29153a95:

    # julia "This is just a bit of speculation, but I think Trida is most comfortable when they're around you."
    julia  "Ini cuma sedikit analisaku aja sih, tapi kurasa Trida itu paling merasa nyaman dan jadi dirinya sendiri pas lagi ada di dekatmu."

# game/week9.rpy:246
translate indonesian week9_start_4177f328:

    # julia "They're always smiling around everyone, sure, but it simply comes naturally with you."
    julia  "Dia emang selalu senyum dan ceria ke semua orang, itu bener, tapi pas lagi bareng kamu, senyuman itu kelihatan mengalir begitu alami tanpa paksaan."

# game/week9.rpy:247
translate indonesian week9_start_1e1995c7:

    # julia "I think Trida appreciates how patient and understanding you are; they feel like an equal instead of someone to constantly appeal to."
    julia  "Menurutku Trida sangat menghargai betapa sabar dan pengertiannya dirimu; dia ngerasa dihargai sebagai sosok yang setara, bukan seseorang yang dituntut harus selalu menyenangkan orang lain."

# game/week9.rpy:248
translate indonesian week9_start_fcc2e9c1:

    # julia "As long as you remain that safe space for Trida, I don't think it's out of the realm of possibility that…"
    julia  "Selama kamu terus jadi tempat bersandar yang aman buat Trida, aku rasa bukan hal yang mustahil kalau..."

# game/week9.rpy:249
translate indonesian week9_start_9cf963d7:

    # julia "…Trida feels the same way about you."
    julia  "...Trida sebenarnya punya perasaan yang sama terhadapmu."

# game/week9.rpy:250
translate indonesian week9_start_7c2a20ea:

    # p "You… really think so?"
    p  "Kamu... beneran mikir begitu?"

# game/week9.rpy:251
translate indonesian week9_start_cab16a2f:

    # julia "Well, that's just how I see it. I'd be very surprised if Trida felt any other way, especially with the way they look at you."
    julia  "Ya, itu yang kulihat sejauh ini. Aku malah bakal heran banget kalau sampai Trida ngerasa sebaliknya, apalagi kalau ngelihat cara dia menatapmu selama ini."

# game/week9.rpy:252
translate indonesian week9_start_a76c521b:

    # julia "Besides, you'd make an amazing partner for Trida anyway."
    julia  "Lagian, kamu bakal jadi pasangan yang luar biasa sempurna buat Trida kok."

# game/week9.rpy:258
translate indonesian week9_start_4abd5d8c:

    # julia "I see… I can really see that Trida is important to you."
    julia  "Begitu ya... Kelihatan banget kalau Trida bener-bener sosok yang sangat berharga buat kamu."

# game/week9.rpy:259
translate indonesian week9_start_a50a282c:

    # julia "Maybe this is an odd thing to say about someone else's friendship, but I have a feeling you two will always have each other's backs until the end."
    julia  "Mungkin agak aneh ya mengomentari hubungan persahabatan orang lain, tapi aku punya firasat kuat kalau kalian berdua bakal selalu saling mendukung sampai kapan pun."

# game/week9.rpy:260
translate indonesian week9_start_e5a27375:

    # n "Julia's thoughtful words felt unexpected from someone like her, but you couldn't deny her pleased expression and tone of voice."
    n  "Kata-kata bijak Julia terdengar begitu tak terduga datang dari sosok pendiam sepertinya, namun kamu tak bisa memungkiri kehangatan tulus yang terpancar dari ekspresi dan nada bicaranya."

# game/week9.rpy:261
translate indonesian week9_start_33f06b14:

    # p "Yeah? How could you tell…?"
    p  "Iya kah? Dari mana kamu bisa tahu...?"

# game/week9.rpy:262
translate indonesian week9_start_6b94cc4a:

    # julia "I'd say you two bring out the best in each other; you seem the most comfortable at school when together."
    julia  "Menurutku kalian berdua saling mengeluarkan sisi terbaik dari diri masing-masing; kalian kelihatan paling rileks dan damai pas lagi berdua di sekolah."

# game/week9.rpy:263
translate indonesian week9_start_d4db89d4:

    # julia "I mean, Trida is always the social butterfly, but they seem to mellow out when talking with you. It's when their true personality really shines."
    julia  "Maksudku, Trida emang anak yang gampang gaul, tapi dia kelihatan jauh lebih tenang dan jujur tiap kali ngobrol berdua sama kamu. Di saat itulah kepribadian aslinya bener-bener bersinar indah."

# game/week9.rpy:264
translate indonesian week9_start_cca62c1e:

    # julia "Dare I say your personalities complement each other perfectly."
    julia  "Bisa dibilang kepribadian kalian berdua tuh saling melengkapi dengan begitu sempurna."

# game/week9.rpy:265
translate indonesian week9_start_6382aa4d:

    # julia "I suppose what I'm saying is… don't ever let go of Trida, alright?"
    julia  "Intinya yang mau kusampaikan... jangan pernah lepasin ikatan berhargamu sama Trida ya, janji?"

# game/week9.rpy:266
translate indonesian week9_start_ff5c5c5e:

    # p "Thank you, Julia… I'm glad you think so."
    p  "Makasih banyak ya, Julia... Aku seneng banget dengar pandanganmu."

# game/week9.rpy:267
translate indonesian week9_start_dbda490d:

    # julia "It's nothing, just looking out for you two!"
    julia  "Sama-sama, cuma pengin yang terbaik aja buat kalian berdua!"

# game/week9.rpy:269
translate indonesian week9_start_82f9049d:

    # n "It was then you heard loud pants and footsteps approaching from behind."
    n  "Tepat saat itu, suara napas terengah-engah dan derap langkah kaki terdengar memburu dari arah belakang."

# game/week9.rpy:272
translate indonesian week9_start_39e47dbc:

    # trida "I'm back!!"
    trida  "Aku baliiik!!"

# game/week9.rpy:274
translate indonesian week9_start_332c7ffb:

    # n "Trida's announcement pierced through the ambiance of the crowd as they came running towards you, flailing the acquired wallet in their hand like a gold medal."
    n  "Seruan lantang Trida membelah riuhnya kantin saat ia berlari kencang menghampiri kalian, mengacungkan dompet yang berhasil ia temukan di tangannya laksana medali emas kejuaraan."

# game/week9.rpy:275
translate indonesian week9_start_e1b9e3d5:

    # n "Within barely a second, Trida speeded past you and Julia, bent over gasping for air as they counted the bills in their hand."
    n  "Hanya dalam hitungan detik, Trida meluncur melewati bangku kalian berdua, membungkuk terengah-engah memburu udara seraya menghitung lembaran uang di tangannya."

# game/week9.rpy:277
translate indonesian week9_start_d4dcd31a:

    # p "Speak of the devil…"
    p  "Panjang umur baru aja diomongin..."

# game/week9.rpy:279
translate indonesian week9_start_1fefa308:

    # julia "I reckon you'd like to keep our discussions a secret, yes?"
    julia  "Kurasa obrolan rahasia kita tadi mending kita simpan berdua aja ya, gimana?"

# game/week9.rpy:280
translate indonesian week9_start_53edfe0f:

    # n "Julia chuckled with a glint in her eyes, her knowing grin playfully teasing your embarrassment."
    n  "Julia tertawa kecil dengan binar usil di matanya, seringai penuh artinya menggoda rasa malumu."

# game/week9.rpy:282
translate indonesian week9_start_d1efbde4:

    # n "Trida soon arrived at your bench with a styrofoam box abundant with fried noodles and a sizable sunny-side-up egg."
    n  "Tak lama berselang, Trida kembali ke bangku kalian membawa kotak stirofoam berisi tumpukan mi goreng yang harum mengepul dengan telur mata sapi yang menggoda selera."

# game/week9.rpy:284
translate indonesian week9_start_a91b1fa2:

    # trida "Sorry for the wait, guys! I swear I did {i}not{/i} recall my wallet being under my table of all places—"
    trida  "Maaf ya bikin kalian nunggu lama! Sumpah deh aku bener-bener {i}nggak{/i} inget kalau dompetku bisa nyelip di kolong meja gitu—"

# game/week9.rpy:285
translate indonesian week9_start_75c1fe73:

    # trida "Eh, Julia? Hey, Julia! Didn't realize you were here too!"
    trida  "Eh, Julia? Halo, Julia! Nggak nyadar kamu di sini juga!"

# game/week9.rpy:287
translate indonesian week9_start_42902b32:

    # julia "Ah, hey, Trida…! It's been a while since we talked, right?"
    julia  "Ah, halo Trida...! Udah lama ya kita nggak ngobrol bareng?"

# game/week9.rpy:288
translate indonesian week9_start_89b63368:

    # trida "Oh, totally!"
    trida  "Iya banget dong!"

# game/week9.rpy:290
translate indonesian week9_start_75b12ac0:

    # n "You could already see the gears revving up in Trida's head upon talking to a fellow nerd, their smile widening with energy."
    n  "Kamu sudah bisa melihat roda antusiasme mulai berputar cepat di kepala Trida begitu bertemu sesama pecinta karya fiksi, senyumnya melebar penuh energi."

# game/week9.rpy:291
translate indonesian week9_start_a62185aa:

    # trida "You know, I watched that Nimecart series you told me about! Ah, what was it called—the Sanity one?"
    trida  "Tahu nggak, aku udah nonton serial Nimecart yang tempo hari kamu rekomendasikan lho! Ah, apa itu namanya—yang seri Sanity itu kan?"

# game/week9.rpy:293
translate indonesian week9_start_ebdb859a:

    # julia "Oh! You actually watched it? What did you think of it?"
    julia  "Wah! Kamu beneran nonton? Gimana menurutmu ceritanya?"

# game/week9.rpy:295
translate indonesian week9_start_9b786e34:

    # trida "It's SO fun! The storytelling is so cool, and all of the members are really good improvisers—I'm really curious how it's gonna go for future episodes!"
    trida  "SERU BANGET! Plot storytelling-nya keren parah, terus interaksi improvisasi karakternya pada jago-jago banget—asli penasaran banget gimana kelanjutan episode-episode depannya nanti!"

# game/week9.rpy:296
translate indonesian week9_start_bcec6a82:

    # julia "Right? The world-building is subtle, but still so effective. Oh, I could go on, but—wait, who's your favorite, Trida?"
    julia  "Kan bener! Pembangunan dunianya subtle tapi dapet banget nuansanya. Wah, kalau dibahas bisa panjang nih, tapi—bentar, karakter favoritmu siapa, Trida?"

# game/week9.rpy:297
translate indonesian week9_start_3f42fd44:

    # trida "Oh man, they all have really interesting storylines…"
    trida  "Aduh, semuanya punya latar belakang cerita yang menarik banget sih..."

# game/week9.rpy:299
translate indonesian week9_start_3e9803af:

    # n "You continue to quietly observe Trida and Julia's excited yapping that goes on for longer than expected."
    n  "Kamu terus mengamati dalam diam obrolan seru penuh antusias antara Trida dan Julia yang berlangsung lebih lama dari yang diperkirakan."

# game/week9.rpy:300
translate indonesian week9_start_c351cd6f:

    # n "This was the most natural you've seen Julia be, and you once again admire Trida's bright energy that effortlessly puts people at ease."
    n  "Ini adalah momen paling lepas dan alami yang pernah kamu lihat dari sosok Julia, dan kamu sekali lagi dibuat kagum oleh pesona energi ceria Trida yang dengan mudahnya membuat orang di sekitarnya merasa nyaman."

# game/week9.rpy:301
translate indonesian week9_start_89ce5076:

    # n "You enjoy the laughs and opinions exchanged, soaking in the positive vibes."
    n  "Kamu menikmati gelak tawa dan pertukaran pendapat mereka, meresapi hangatnya atmosfer positif yang mengalir."

# game/week9.rpy:303
translate indonesian week9_start_df05875c:

    # trida "Oh—actually, reminds me… What were you and [player_name] talking about earlier anyway?"
    trida  "Oh iya—ngomong-ngomong... tadi kamu sama [player_name] lagi asyik ngomongin apa sih sebenarnya?"

# game/week9.rpy:307
translate indonesian week9_start_0a663e76:

    # p "We were just chatting about nothing in particular."
    p  "Tadi kita cuma ngobrol santai biasa aja kok."

# game/week9.rpy:309
translate indonesian week9_start_3a576a08:

    # trida "And why do I find that hard to believe, hm? You two seem a little less awkward now."
    trida  "Hmm, kenapa ya rasanya susah banget buat percaya? Kalian berdua kelihatan jauh lebih akrab dan nggak canggung sekarang."

# game/week9.rpy:311
translate indonesian week9_start_87a92871:

    # julia "Heh…"
    julia  "Hehehe..."

# game/week9.rpy:312
translate indonesian week9_start_95a4a54e:

    # trida "And that laugh isn't convincing either!"
    trida  "Tuh kan, ketawanya Julia aja kedengeran mencurigakan banget!"

# game/week9.rpy:314
translate indonesian week9_start_33d0096d:

    # p "Julia was just talking to me about Nimecart."
    p  "Tadi Julia cuma lagi cerita soal Nimecart ke aku."

# game/week9.rpy:316
translate indonesian week9_start_000d243c:

    # trida "Huh, wouldn't have thought of you as a Nimecart type of person."
    trida  "Masa sih? Nggak nyangka deh kamu tipe orang yang suka nonton Nimecart."

# game/week9.rpy:317
translate indonesian week9_start_180951f3:

    # trida "Tell me something about the series then!"
    trida  "Coba sebutin satu hal tentang serialnya kalau emang bener!"

# game/week9.rpy:318
translate indonesian week9_start_b5e3dc5e:

    # p "Uhm… the, uh… Insanity series is—"
    p  "Uhm... itu, seri yang... Insanity itu kan ceritanya—"

# game/week9.rpy:320
translate indonesian week9_start_d827163c:

    # trida "Pfft, you couldn't even get the name of it right!"
    trida  "Pfft, hahaha! Nyebut judul serinya aja kamu udah salah total gitu!"

# game/week9.rpy:321
translate indonesian week9_start_f06feb31:

    # julia "Heheh…"
    julia  "Hehehe..."

# game/week9.rpy:323
translate indonesian week9_start_76259635:

    # p "Ah, we were just agonizingly waiting for you to come back with your wallet."
    p  "Tadi kita berdua cuma lagi tersiksa nungguin kamu yang lama banget balik ngambil dompet."

# game/week9.rpy:325
translate indonesian week9_start_80bff46b:

    # trida "HEY! Didn't you see how fast I was sprinting?!"
    trida  "WOI! Kamu nggak lihat apa tadi lariku secepat kilat gitu?!"

# game/week9.rpy:326
translate indonesian week9_start_f6286873:

    # p "No amount of sprinting could save how slow your eyes are."
    p  "Mau lari secepat kilat pun nggak bakal bisa nyelamatin matamu yang lambat nyari barang."

# game/week9.rpy:328
translate indonesian week9_start_e56fdd20:

    # trida "I REALLY couldn't tell where it was for the life of me!"
    trida  "Sumpah deh tadi dompetnya bener-bener nggak kelihatan di mana-mana!"

# game/week9.rpy:329
translate indonesian week9_start_dcd286b5:

    # julia "Ehehe…"
    julia  "Ehehehe..."

# game/week9.rpy:333
translate indonesian week9_start_1e5446e7:

    # n "The three of you laugh together around the warm smell of noodles and canteen chatter."
    n  "Kalian bertiga tertawa riang bersama di tengah hangatnya aroma mi goreng dan riuhnya obrolan anak-anak di kantin."

# game/week9.rpy:334
translate indonesian week9_start_3bf1f502:

    # n "As the lunch bell approaches, you look at Trida—happier, lighter, and closer to you than ever before."
    n  "Saat bel masuk kelas kian mendekat, kamu menatap wajah Trida—tampak jauh lebih bahagia, lebih lepas, dan terasa begitu dekat dengan hatimu dibanding hari-hari sebelumnya."

